==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 0.4 seconds<sup>12f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns.

